Oh, a pirate's life is the life for me! #speaker:Dodo #portrait:Dodo
Tiddle-ee-um pom pom 
Deedle dum dum dee... 
Hello, sir... I don't think it is safe. #speaker:Alice #portrait:Alice
A young lady? What are you doing here, the show did not started yet! #speaker:Dodo #portrait:Dodo
Tweedle Dee was looking for his brother and I am pretty sure that's him... He's worried sick, sir! #speaker:Alice #portrait:Alice
And how can you be so sure it is him? #speaker:Dodo #portrait:Dodo
He said they look the same, but different... #speaker:Alice #portrait:Alice
She's right, Dodo! I am Tweedle Dum and I am not a part of your knife throwing act! #speaker:Tweedle Dum #portrait:Tweedle_dum
But without my memory cards, knife throwing is the only way for me to dazzle the audience with my eye of an eagle!  #speaker:Dodo #portrait:Dodo
And what could make it more engaging than throwing knives at a living target?
If you keep throwing these knives at me, I won't be a 'living' target for long!!! #speaker:Tweedle Dum #portrait:Tweedle_dum
Sir, if I help you find your cards, will you let Tweedle Dum go? #speaker:Alice #portrait:Alice
You'd do that? That's so kind of you, young lady! #speaker:Dodo #portrait:Dodo
But... I haven't seen my cards for quite a while! What if my memory got terrible and I'll fumble the whole show with this trick?! 
Come to think of it, I think it's safer to stick with my knife throwing act.
Safer for who?! #speaker:Tweedle Dum #portrait:Tweedle_dum
Okay, okay! Then how about I help you practise after I find your cards, would that be alright?  #speaker:Alice #portrait:Alice
Besides, then you can throw knives at the cards, I'm sure that you hitting such small targets will be impressive for your audience as well.
And you won't kill your targets by accident! #speaker:Tweedle Dum #portrait:Tweedle_dum
It seems you really want me to let that whining mermaid go, young lady... #speaker:Dodo #portrait:Dodo
Well, if you give me all the help you promised, then so be it! I will alter the schedule of my performance for you.
Thank you, sir...?  #speaker:Alice #portrait:Alice
(I better hurry up...)
